# src/CareRoute.Api/CareRoute.Api.http   (manual checks · L03)
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7038/api/v1
@emmaId = 0f8fad5b-d9cb-469f-a165-70867728950e
@lucasId = 7c9e6679-7425-40de-944b-e07fc1f90ae7

### 1. First page, default size
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients

### 2. Page 1, size 2 → hasNextPage: true
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?page=1&pageSize=2

### 3. Search "pee" → only Emma Peeters
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?search=pee

### 4. Page size 1000 → 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?pageSize=1000

### 5. Get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{emmaId}}

### 6. Register → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Sofie", "lastName": "Willems", "dateOfBirth": "1979-03-21" }

### 7. Replace Emma (send twice → same result both times)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{emmaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Emma", "lastName": "Peeters-Claes", "dateOfBirth": "1985-07-30" }

### 8. PUT unknown id → 404 patient_not_found
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ghost", "lastName": "Patient", "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01" }

### 9. Delete Lucas (send twice → 204, then 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{lucasId}}

### 10. Unknown route → 404 ProblemDetails (not empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors

### 11. Wrong method → 405 ProblemDetails
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{emmaId}}

### 12. Wrong content type → 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: text/plain

Sofie Willems

### 13. Referral policy (moved to v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/referral-policy

### 14. OpenAPI contract
GET https://localhost:7038/openapi/v1.json

### C2a. page=0 → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?page=0

### C2b. pageSize=0 → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?pageSize=0

### C4. Last page
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?page=2&pageSize=2

### C5. Beyond last page → empty items
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?page=5&pageSize=2

### C13. Simulated crash (DEV ONLY) → 500 without internals
GET https://localhost:7038/api/diagnostics/throw

### C14. Query string must not be echoed in "instance"
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors?search=Peeters